{"id": "63361", "title": "残奴", "author": "黑颜", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 37, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63361.htm", "intro": "云想衣裳花想容，作为女儿家， 谁都想拥有倾城之姿倾国之貌。 她与她美艳无双， 本应是集万千宠爱于一身，可是， 一个万里追情郎，却被视为风骚浪荡； 一个如笼中鸟一无是处，被心上人视为敝屣。 而是让他过得开心舒畅时， 谁来告诉她何去何从？ 当容颜变残颜时， 他可还记得过往中有个她？ 草原儿女，爱得热烈，爱得奔放， 她们受心的指引，勇感向前！", "base": "files/article/html/63/63361", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "9368708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "9368710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "9368713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "9368714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "9368715.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "9368719.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "9368720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "9368722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "9368725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "9368726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "9368727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "9368729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "9368731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "9368733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "9368735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "9368737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "9368739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "9368741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "9368743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "9368744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "9368745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "9368746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "9368749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "9368751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "9368753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26页", "file": "93